    "chassis_active": "ABS/TCS/VSE active states are read from CAN_PB 0x0AC primary signals and CAN_PB 0x0AE ICE2 signals. Preprocessing builds final abs_active/tcs_active/vse_active by using any valid active value from either source. ch3 is preferred for primary signals; ch4/ch2/ch1 are fallback paths.",
    "slope_deg": "Debug_single_Reserved_51 is road slope in deg. slope_acc = 9.80665 * sin(slope_deg), only used by slope_no_frnt_* metrics.",
